<div class="report-page">
<div class="report-shell">

  <!-- COVER -->
  <div class="cover animate-in">
    <div class="cover-eyebrow">ProActive Pixels &nbsp;·&nbsp; Operations Assessment</div>
    <div class="cover-body">
      <div class="cover-headline">Operations</div>
      <div class="cover-sub">Assessment</div>
      <div class="cover-meta">
        <div class="cover-org">Piedmont Free Clinic &nbsp;·&nbsp; Charlottesville, Virginia</div>
        <div class="cover-date">May 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Confidential</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- EXECUTIVE SUMMARY -->
  <div class="summary-section animate-in" style="animation-delay:.1s">
    <div class="section-label">Executive Summary</div>
    <div class="summary-lede">390 hours of clinical capacity. Lost every year to a problem <em>that can be automated.</em></div>
    <div class="summary-body">
      <p>Piedmont Free Clinic sees approximately 30 patients per day. At a 7% no-show rate, that is roughly 2 missed appointments daily. Each one represents 45 minutes of clinical staff preparation time that never resulted in care.</p>
      <p>That is 390 hours per year. Ten full work weeks. This assessment identifies appointment reminder automation as your highest-impact, lowest-risk starting point. Three additional workflows where automation can reclaim hours and redirect them to the patients on your waitlist are covered in the sections that follow.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- PRIMARY FINDING -->
  <div class="finding-section animate-in" style="animation-delay:.15s">
    <div class="section-label">Primary Finding</div>
    <h2 class="section-h2">Your no-show problem <em>by the numbers.</em></h2>

    <div class="finding-grid">
      <div class="finding-cell">
        <span class="finding-value">390</span>
        <span class="finding-label">Clinical staff hours lost to no-shows annually</span>
        <span class="finding-sub">Based on 2 no-shows/day at 45 min prep time per appointment</span>
      </div>
      <div class="finding-cell">
        <span class="finding-value">10 wks</span>
        <span class="finding-label">Of full-time staff capacity unrecovered each year</span>
        <span class="finding-sub">Equivalent to a part-time coordinator's annual contribution</span>
      </div>
      <div class="finding-cell">
        <span class="finding-value">7%</span>
        <span class="finding-label">Average no-show rate at free and community clinics</span>
        <span class="finding-sub">Compared to 5–8% across all outpatient specialties nationally</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="alert">
      <div class="alert-body">
        <div class="alert-headline">This is a conservative estimate.</div>
        <div class="alert-text">Free clinics serving uninsured and underserved populations consistently see no-show rates above 7% due to transportation barriers, work schedule conflicts, and limited rescheduling access. Your actual figure may be higher. The automation addresses the root cause: patients who forget, not patients who cannot attend.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- COST BREAKDOWN -->
  <div class="cost-section animate-in" style="animation-delay:.2s">
    <div class="section-label">Cost Breakdown</div>
    <h2 class="section-h2">What each no-show <em>actually costs</em> your clinic.</h2>
    <div class="cost-layout">
      <div class="metric-block" data-num="01">
        <div class="metric-value">45 min</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Staff prep time per appointment</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">Chart review · room setup · intake prep</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-block" data-num="02">
        <div class="metric-value">$14.40</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Direct cost per no-show</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">At $19.20/hr blended staff rate</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-block" data-num="03">
        <div class="metric-value">2/day</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Average missed appointments</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">At 7% no-show rate, 30 patients/day</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-block" data-num="04">
        <div class="metric-value">$5,616</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Annual cost of no-shows</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">Direct staff time only, not overhead or lost waitlist capacity</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cost-note">
      The $5,616 figure covers direct staff time only. It does not include the overhead cost of each unfilled slot, the lost opportunity of a waitlisted patient who could have been seen, or the downstream health impact of delayed care for someone managing a chronic condition.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SOLUTION -->
  <div class="solution-section animate-in" style="animation-delay:.25s">
    <div class="section-label">Recommended Solution: Priority 1</div>
    <h2 class="section-h2">Automated appointment reminders with two-way confirmation.</h2>
    <p class="solution-intro">Every patient scheduled receives an automated reminder 48 hours before their appointment, followed by a 24-hour confirmation request. If they confirm, the slot is locked. If they do not respond or cancel, the slot opens for waitlist backfill automatically. Your staff doesn't touch the phone.</p>

    <div class="checklist">
      <div class="check-item">
        <div class="check-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><polyline points="2,6 5,9 10,3"/></svg></div>
        <div class="check-text"><strong>Front desk staff stops spending 2+ hours daily</strong> on manual confirmation calls</div>
      </div>
      <div class="check-item">
        <div class="check-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><polyline points="2,6 5,9 10,3"/></svg></div>
        <div class="check-text"><strong>No-show rates typically drop to the 2–3% range</strong> at clinics using automated reminder systems</div>
      </div>
      <div class="check-item">
        <div class="check-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><polyline points="2,6 5,9 10,3"/></svg></div>
        <div class="check-text"><strong>Waitlisted patients receive automatic outreach</strong> when a slot opens</div>
      </div>
      <div class="check-item">
        <div class="check-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><polyline points="2,6 5,9 10,3"/></svg></div>
        <div class="check-text"><strong>Your coordinator sees real-time appointment status</strong> without touching the phone</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="impact-strip">
      <div class="impact-cell">
        <div class="impact-value">270 hrs</div>
        <div class="impact-label"><strong>Staff hours reclaimed annually</strong><br/>Reduction from 390 to ~120 hrs at 2% no-show rate</div>
      </div>
      <div class="impact-cell">
        <div class="impact-value">150+</div>
        <div class="impact-label"><strong>Additional patients served per year</strong><br/>From waitlist backfill of recovered slots</div>
      </div>
      <div class="impact-cell">
        <div class="impact-value">$3,900</div>
        <div class="impact-label"><strong>In direct staff cost recovered</strong><br/>Conservative estimate at blended rate</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ADDITIONAL OPPORTUNITIES -->
  <div class="opps-section animate-in" style="animation-delay:.3s">
    <div class="section-label">Additional Automation Opportunities</div>
    <h2 class="section-h2">Three more workflows consuming staff time.</h2>
    <div class="opp-list">
      <div class="opp-item">
        <div class="opp-num">02</div>
        <div class="opp-body">
          <div class="opp-title">Patient Intake and Eligibility Screening</div>
          <div class="opp-desc">Forms completed by hand, re-entered into your system, reviewed for errors. Every new patient costs 45–60 minutes of staff time before they have seen a provider.</div>
          <div class="opp-meta">
            <span>8–12 hrs/week saved</span>
            <span>Complexity: Medium</span>
            <span>HIPAA compliant</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="opp-item">
        <div class="opp-num">03</div>
        <div class="opp-body">
          <div class="opp-title">Follow-Up Care Instructions and Referral Coordination</div>
          <div class="opp-desc">Patients leaving with referrals depend on staff to manually communicate next steps. Missed follow-ups are a leading cause of condition escalation in underserved populations.</div>
          <div class="opp-meta">
            <span>4–6 hrs/week saved</span>
            <span>Complexity: Low</span>
            <span>HIPAA compliant</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="opp-item">
        <div class="opp-num">04</div>
        <div class="opp-body">
          <div class="opp-title">Volunteer Coordinator Communications</div>
          <div class="opp-desc">Shift confirmations, hour tracking, and schedule changes handled through a chain of texts and spreadsheets. When a volunteer does not respond, the follow-up chain starts over.</div>
          <div class="opp-meta">
            <span>3–4 hrs/week saved</span>
            <span>Complexity: Low</span>
            <span>HIPAA: N/A</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- PROPOSED TOOLS -->
  <div class="tools-section animate-in" style="animation-delay:.33s">
    <div class="section-label">Proposed Tools &amp; Monthly Investment</div>
    <h2 class="section-h2">Platforms that fit each workflow.</h2>
    <p class="tools-intro">Every platform listed below carries an executed Business Associate Agreement (BAA) for HIPAA compliance. Each is a prebuilt, subscription-based service. Monthly subscription costs are paid directly to each vendor by your organization.</p>

    <div class="tools-grid">
